{
 "duration": 52.925,
 "exact_word_timing": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "This alligator is secret number one of five that streamers found in GTA 6.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 4.949
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Number one.",
   "start": 5.399,
   "end": 6.345
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Speed walked right up to it. Bad idea.",
   "start": 6.565,
   "end": 8.911
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "It lunged, grabbed Jason, and dragged him straight through the grass.",
   "start": 9.131,
   "end": 12.445
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Number two.",
   "start": 12.895,
   "end": 13.917
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "This parrot keeps saying, hey handsome.",
   "start": 14.137,
   "end": 16.167
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Ask it where the cash is, and it screams, generator!",
   "start": 16.387,
   "end": 18.994
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Behind the grate? Fourteen hundred and five dollars.",
   "start": 19.214,
   "end": 22.265
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Number three.",
   "start": 22.715,
   "end": 23.758
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Lirik came up in the middle of the ocean, and a German shepherd was just sitting on a jet ski.",
   "start": 23.978,
   "end": 28.778
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "He climbed on, and the dog drove him back to shore.",
   "start": 28.998,
   "end": 31.799
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Number four.",
   "start": 32.249,
   "end": 33.248
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Jason has a pet snake named Dolores.",
   "start": 33.468,
   "end": 35.73
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "And yes, you can feed her a rat. She eats it.",
   "start": 35.95,
   "end": 38.587
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Number five.",
   "start": 39.037,
   "end": 40.037
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Lirik spotted Bigfoot in the swamp.",
   "start": 40.257,
   "end": 42.123
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "He went looking for him, blacked out, and woke up alone, asking, did he do something to me?",
   "start": 42.343,
   "end": 47.265
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Which one would catch you off guard first?",
   "start": 47.715,
   "end": 49.751
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Because it all started with this alligator.",
   "start": 49.971,
   "end": 52.075
  }
 ],
